# Cloudflare Pages headers. The service worker and the HTML must never be served stale,
# otherwise installed copies of the game would not pick up new deploys.
# /assets/* keeps the Pages default (revalidate on every load). It used to be immutable for a year: during the 0.7.9
# deploy a request for a new bundle got the SPA fallback (index.html) on wingnut-circus.com, the zone cached that HTML as
# the script for a year and the game would not start until the cache was purged. With 404.html missing files 404 instead.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json
